/*
 * Implements semantic validation for function symbols.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - prototype validation for declared and template-instantiated functions,
 *   - validation of parameters, return types, attributes, and throwers,
 *   - validation of function bodies(when requested),
 *   - construction of PrototypeValue and FrameGenerator entries,
 *   - enforcement of unsafe contexts and return-type rules,
 *   - detection of function collisions and invalid main signatures.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
